{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ויהי, לאמר</b> — In this place, לאמר (saying) refers to this people, unlike in the Torah, for in וידבר השם אל משה לאמר (YHWH spoke to Moses, saying) the meaning is: speak to Moses to tell him the matter; therefore afterward, דבר אל בני ישראל ואמרת להם (speak to the children of Israel and say to them)."], :book :haggai, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Haggai" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"] ["Ibn Ezra on Haggai -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:21.359126253Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}